### Test Register API

### 1. Valid Registration
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser999",
  "email": "testuser999@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Invalid - Missing email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Invalid - Bad email format
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 4. Invalid - Short password
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 5. Login after register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser999",
  "password": "123456"
}
